   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Wonderful Man**: rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n- **O is the One**: rare: 5 archived performances [6]\n- **Tonight I Want to Celebrate**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-11-16.schoepsmk4.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 134 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording features great sound quality; PA problems caused pops and distortion noise in the first few songs [1][3]\n- **MMJ2006-11-22.dpa4023s.flac6**: source not stated; 22 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jim played an old song on his omniphone during the set [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-11-16.schoepsmk4.flac**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: FOB Schoeps mk4 (DIN) > kc5 > cmc6 > Lunatec V2 > Sound Devices 702 @24/48 [1]\n- **MMJ2006-11-22.dpa4023s.flac6**: taped by Shane Sheffield; transferred by Shane Sheffield; source: dpa4023's(NOS)>V3>D-8@44.1 [2]",
